  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞这里究竟是什么地方……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_303.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞“联谊咖啡厅”终成眷属……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_303.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 08 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 0D 01 07 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}可恶……\n竟敢这样对待冠军……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_303.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 C1 1A 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 0D 01 08 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}……？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_303.bf.json:2:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 08 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}我到底赢了什么比赛？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_303.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 13 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}看来，你们已经抵达了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_303.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 0D 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}又是这个声音……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_303.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 14 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}这里似乎是一条让邂逅命定伴侣的\n恋人们倾诉爱意的道路。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_303.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 15 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}前方究竟有什么在等待呢？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_303.bf.json:5:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 16 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}你们可以手牵着手，\n怀着好奇与恐惧迈出脚步，\n也可以不迈出。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_303.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 06 01}真是的……\n命定伴侣、恋人什么的，\n都在胡说些什么……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_303.bf.json:6:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}算了。\n看来，要不要前进，\n可以由我们自己决定。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_303.bf.json:6:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}现在应该冷静判断……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_303.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 17 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}我说，你们可以迈出脚步，\n也可以不迈出。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_303.bf.json:7:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 18 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}来，迈出脚步吧！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_303.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞机械语音消失了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_303.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 09 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}……这不是没得选吗。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_303.bf.json:9:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}那就只能前进了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_303.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}可能是陷阱{F5 47 02 01 03 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_303.bf.json:10:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}我不想去{F5 47 02 01 03 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_303.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}不是可能，当然是陷阱。\n现在只有我们两个，\n别忘了战力已经大幅下降。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_303.bf.json:11:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0C 01}……不过，不用担心。\n不管来什么阴影，\n我都会用拳头把它打倒。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_303.bf.json:11:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0D 01}再怎么说，\n我也是你的学长。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_303.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0E 01}那要等他们过来吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_303.bf.json:12:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0F 01}可别等着等着，\n一切都已经结束了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_303.bf.json:12:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 10 01}……还真有可能。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_303.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0122",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 11 01}我们要逃出这里。\n无论如何都要。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_303.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 12 01}好，准备好了吗？\n别大意。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 }
]